{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"24395e4be45eeb901753e6b64e833a91880acc5bed29439c6b24d94ff762aa5d","ja":"宣伝動画を撮ろう！","zh":"来拍宣传视频吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"10b768bedd31540c6494fdbe42267c21110d75f1ff635956eb2bd625090569ef","ja":"今日の星梨花と環のお仕事は映画の宣伝動画の撮影。\n自分達で企画立案から行うことになっていて……","zh":"今天星梨花和环的工作是拍摄电影宣传视频。\n她们要从策划方案开始亲自着手完成……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"157936ad3f167f2a7e2388a920a060db04e4db382b7b19e9fd7414a609aadb47","ja":"宣伝だから、わたし達の役か\n映画の内容に関係することを、した方がいいよね？","zh":"既然是宣传，做些和我们演的角色\n或者电影内容相关的事情会比较好吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ab4f7258624c58bad01a70fa6bc3831ba556a7582e1e246b45fe88d1868228a6","ja":"あっ、それならたまき、食べ物屋さんやりたい！\nせりか、映画で屋台やってたでしょ！","zh":"啊，那样的话环想开小吃店！\n星梨花，你之前在电影里摆过摊吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"02ccaff2781ce3d05d4ca32685af32d4b23f09bf886900103d41bd109779487c","ja":"じゃあ、売り上げの目標をきめて、\n達成できるか挑戦する、っていう企画はどうかな？","zh":"那定个销售额目标，\n来挑战看看能不能达成的企划怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3eec8df5af9c91de92c10bfe02c0b238af78c3f6f08c3ebed8605891c2bbd899","ja":"うん！　すっごく楽しそうだね♪\nじゃあ、なに屋さんにする？","zh":"嗯！听起来真好玩呢♪\n那么，要开什么店呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8ae9c73db420afb724b9732d43cb3f26e3a216bdc0cd44bfe05780dbe8f3b567","ja":"うーん……できるだけ、\nわたし達で作れるお料理にしたいよね……。","zh":"嗯……尽量还是做成\n我们自己就能做的菜比较好吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8a0fbae7b7476aa67d56d65b68ee79f754794fac3b005629ca272c75b5e395cb","ja":"たまき、果物とか野菜を切ったり、\n盛り付けたりならできるよ！","zh":"环会切水果和蔬菜，\n还会摆盘哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"56b9690b3127390efdd39b83f02e2dd7569bf25da56364e620e92fd74c2eb8dd","ja":"火を使わなくても作れるものなら\nいいのかな？　うーん……。","zh":"不用火也能做出来的东西\n就可以了吗？唔……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"84222123cea8c392071d23c8cdf71aca50fcb5547cd2a34c07e4f6283d1c8b05","ja":"「……日は、一日を通して晴れ。非常に\n気温が高く、真夏日になりますので、熱中症に……」","zh":"“……天，全天晴朗。气温非常\n高，将迎来盛夏日，请做好防中暑措施……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8fc07bbff1ce08a7a293a09d3284ea1588b6f7f1e042be75bbff56c73a523040","ja":"また、あつくなるんだね。\nもう秋なのに、なかなか涼しくならないぞ。","zh":"又要变热了呢。\n明明已经是秋天了，却总是不凉快下来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e67db49c9dfd3aeeb04dcc33f2c1dcecf0c8d9182ad27e324be14abf918b89fc","ja":"……あれ？\nこの日ってたしか、動画の撮影日だったよね……。","zh":"……咦？\n这天我记得好像是视频的拍摄日吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b987be661120f90d3f281e68f64d1ef0180ab3d094191bda3f690f5bb50b176c","ja":"そうだっ！　環ちゃん、わたし達が出すお店、\n『かき氷屋さん』はどうかな？","zh":"我想到了！环，我们要开的店，\n叫“刨冰店”怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"27b769bfbd7fa4c2b52d666625f2fde5dbf9c768768b67f5dbf47a168339ca99","ja":"うんっ！　かき氷だったら、\nたまきも作れるぞ！","zh":"嗯！　要是刨冰的话，\n环也会做哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1642.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"911bedaa88aaaa32db062a731394aa74cece7053eab886a98d67930d65295a48","ja":"それじゃあ、わたし達の企画は、「かき氷屋さんで、\n目標の売り上げを達成する」、にしましょう！","zh":"那么，我们的企划就定为“在刨冰店\n达成目标销售额”，好不好！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
